
---
const supportUrl = "https://buymemomo.com/sherpashell";
---

<section class="momo-banner">
  <div class="momo-content">
    <div class="momo-label">
      <span class="momo-dot"></span>
      SUPPORT INDEPENDENT CREATORS
    </div>

    <h2>Help me create more valuable content</h2>

    <p>
      I have been writing about Loksewa computer engineering, IT officer, other
      related government roles and private IT careers in Nepal. What I write comes from my
      experience. And experience
      comes from the time, money, and energy I spend over the years in my career.
      In that way, I am saving your time, your money and your energy while solving the
      information asymmetry prevalent in IT careers in Nepal.
      I will feel immensely joyed if you support even Rs. 100.
    </p>

    <a
      href={supportUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored"
      class="momo-button"
    >
      Support me.
      <span class="arrow">↗</span>
    </a>

    <small>Thank you for your support to BerojgarEngineer.com</small>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  .momo-banner {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #f4d6cd;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #fff8f2, #fff0e9);
    color: #292524;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .momo-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 540px;
  }

  .momo-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: #c73535;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.4px;
  }

  .momo-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #dc3636;
  }

  .momo-content h2 {
    margin: 15px 0 10px;
    color: #242424;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .momo-content p {
    max-width: 450px;
    margin: 0 0 23px;
    color: #625b57;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .momo-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 11px;
    padding: 13px 23px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #dc3838;
    color: white !important;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #dc38383b;
    transition: 0.2s ease;
  }

  .momo-button:hover {
    background: #b92323;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .arrow {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .momo-content small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 15px;
    color: #81716b;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .momo-art {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 220px;
    width: 220px;
    height: 190px;
    place-items: center;
  }

  .circle {
    position: absolute;
    width: 175px;
    height: 175px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f8d7c7;
  }

  .momo-emoji {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-size: 105px;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 8px #a15b4540);
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
  }

  .floating-momo {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    font-size: 29px;
  }

  .one {
    top: 8px;
    right: 12px;
    transform: rotate(20deg);
  }

  .two {
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 8px;
    font-size: 23px;
  }

  .art-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -4px;
    color: #a74c3c;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .momo-banner {
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }

    .momo-art {
      display: none;
    }

    .momo-content p {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .momo-button {
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
  }
</style>
